keywords:
  - quaternions
  - octonions
  - non-associative algebra
  - dynamical-systems
  - GPU computing
abstract: >-
  Numerical instrument evolving coupled ensembles of unit quaternions
  (S3) and unit octonions (S7) across dual GPUs, with the octonion
  associator as a self-calibrating collision observable. Code only;
  the associated paper, data, and research artifacts are archived on
  Zenodo. The instrument computes geometry on simulated states; it
  does not act on matter.
